---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms governing the use of the Vaishali Foods website and purchase of products."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Website use</h2>
    <p>
      By using this website or placing an order, you agree to these Terms &
      Conditions and the related policies displayed on the website.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Product information</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to provide accurate product descriptions, prices, weights and
      images. Minor variations may occur because products are prepared in small
      batches.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Pricing</h2>
    <p>
      Prices may change from time to time. The amount shown during checkout is
      the amount applicable to that order.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Orders</h2>
    <p>
      An order may be refused or cancelled if a product is unavailable, payment
      fails, delivery is not serviceable or order details appear incorrect.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Payments</h2>
    <p>
      Online payments are processed through third-party payment gateways.
      Payment confirmation does not guarantee dispatch until the order is
      reviewed and accepted.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Delivery</h2>
    <p>
      Delivery times are estimates and may be affected by courier delays,
      weather, public holidays or events outside our control.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      Vaishali Foods will not be responsible for indirect losses or delays
      caused by circumstances beyond reasonable control.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about these terms, use the details on our
      <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</PolicyLayout>